      "## The bottom line",
      "Most lost leads aren't lost to competitors. They're lost to silence. A simple, friendly follow-up sequence after every inquiry and every estimate wins back jobs you'd otherwise never hear about, and it runs without you having to remember a thing.",
      "Automated follow-up sequences are part of our [Lead & Review System](/pricing), alongside missed call text back, AI website chat and review requests. Related reading: [missed call text back](/blog/missed-call-text-back).",
